From 9ac2f767aa753867fe53ab7fe32bc5b2c49e574e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v2: add Lotus V2 VM, cost model, and ordinary transaction
 validation

Add the Lotus V2 virtual machine (vm.h, vm.cpp, vm_cost.inc) with
1,024-byte BigInt limits, >16-byte multi-word SubBig borrow propagation,
zero-padded byte transfers, P05 static cost scaling, ordinary transaction
validation, ValidatedOrdinaryCache, and unit/differential test suites.
